      <div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0460.didymoi.kock1888-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0460_didymoi">
        <head>ΔΙΔΥΜΟΙ</head>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="4" xml:id="kock-0460-didymoi-4" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0460_didymoi">
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0460-didymoi-4-l1" xml:lang="grc">ὁ γὰρ τὸν ἴδιον οἰκονομῶν κακῶς βίον,</l>
            <l n="2" xml:id="kock-0460-didymoi-4-l2" xml:lang="grc">πῶς οὗτος ἂν σώσειε τῶν ἔξω τινά;</l>
          </lg>
          <note type="source">Stobaeus Floril. 15, 2 Εὔφρονος Διδύμων Voss. Hens. (δυδίμων) et Froben. Εὔφρονος B. ‘nihil enotavi ex A’. Gaisfordus. cum ecl. 1 (Menandri) perperam coniungit Trinc.</note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="5" xml:id="kock-0460-didymoi-5" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0460_didymoi">
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0460-didymoi-5-l1" xml:lang="grc">ὦ Ζεῦ, τί ποθ’ ἡμῖν δοὺς χρόνον τοῦ ζῆν βραχὺν</l>
            <l n="2" xml:id="kock-0460-didymoi-5-l2" xml:lang="grc">πλέκειν ἀλύπως τοῦτον ἡμᾶς οὐκ ἐᾷς;</l>
          </lg>
          <note type="source">Stobaeus Floril. 98, 12 Εὔφρονος Διδύμων Α.</note>
          <note type="apparatus">1. ποθ’] πάνθ’ Α. 2. πλέκειν, ut διαπλέκειν Arist. Av. 754.</note>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
